&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;项目编号：&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lily-s-proposal&quot;&gt;SCP-001&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rhantolkytri&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4905795&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609207571&quot; alt=&quot;RhantolkYtri&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4905795)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rhantolkytri&quot;  &gt;RhantolkYtri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
